<section id="founder" class="founder" data-section="founder">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="exhibit-tag">EXHIBIT G · FOUNDER NOTE</span>

    <blockquote class="founder__quote">
      <p>
        I built FlowDesk because every chart I trusted lied to me at least once,
        and the ones that did not were behind a $40,000 paywall I could not
        stomach. So I wrote the engine. Then I wrote the contract. Then I
        wrote the tests. <em>The math is in the open.</em> The honesty ledger
        is in the open. The schema bumps are explicit. If a number on this
        screen is wrong, you can read why.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is not a community. It is not a course. It is not a Discord with
        a paywall. It is one operator with a screen, building the lens I
        wanted in the chair I sit in.
      </p>
      <footer class="founder__sig">
        <span class="founder__name">— [Founder name placeholder]</span>
        <span class="founder__role label">Operator · Author · One person</span>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder {
    padding-block: var(--section-y);
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .founder .container { max-width: 64rem; }
  .founder__quote {
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vh, 2.5rem);
    padding-left: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--crimson);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .founder__quote p {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.4vw, 1.6rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--ink-100);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .founder__quote em { color: var(--crimson-l); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }
  .founder__sig { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .founder__name { color: var(--ink-100); font-weight: 500; }
</style>
